   "text": "University of Leeds International Study Centre - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Leeds International Study Centre\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLeeds University was ranked 15th in the Uk by the Times and The Sunday Times Good University Guide in 2021 and is a world top 100 university according to the QS World Rankings 2021. \nThe two-semester foundation course aims to help students develop the skills needed to succeed at an undergraduate degree at the University of Leeds. Once students complete the International Foundation Year and meet all the necessary requirements, they can start the first year of their chosen undergraduate degree.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 10:35\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 10:35\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £24,629.19\nMin: £24,629.19\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n5%\n1,900 of 38,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1904\nCampus(es)\nLeeds\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hAUrjUXmGQ\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
